Package: flickos-kit-reversing
Architecture: all
Depends: gdb,
         binutils,
         ltrace,
         strace,
         edb-debugger,
         apktool,
         ghex,
         hexedit,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: FlickOS security kit: reverse engineering
 gdb and edb, ltrace and strace, objdump and readelf, apktool for Android
 apps, and the GHex and hexedit hex editors from Debian. apktool brings a
 Java runtime.
 .
 Ghidra, radare2 and rizin aren't in Debian 13, so they aren't part of the
 kit.
 .
 Use these tools only on computers and networks you own or have permission
 to test.
 .
 A kit is installed from Software's Security Tools and removed there too.
 Nothing it installs runs until it is used
 (docs/design/flickos-security.md).
